ations\"><li class=\"au-obligation\" data-au-obligation=\"obligation:dh_scope:tenancy_terms_evidence\" data-au-document=\"tenancy_terms_evidence\" data-status=\"established\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-document-open au-document-choice\" data-au-select=\"dh_scope\" data-au-select-document=\"tenancy_terms_evidence\" data-au-select-obligation=\"obligation:dh_scope:tenancy_terms_evidence\" data-au-select-fact=\"fact:tenancy_terms_evidence\"><strong>Relevant tenancy terms</strong><span class=\"au-document-state au-document-route\">Established</span><span class=\"au-document-review\" data-au-review=\"sufficient\">Supplied evidence is sufficient. <span aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span></span><span class=\"au-document-decision\">Establish relevant tenancy terms</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-link au-document-source\" data-au-source=\"src_75472589f7c0e2b444f884f3000845b2\" data-au-source-origin=\"requirement:obligation:dh_scope:tenancy_terms_evidence\" data-au-citation=\"{&quot;artifact_id&quot;:&quot;src_75472589f7c0e2b444f884f3000845b2&quot;,&quot;end_char&quot;:978,&quot;quote&quot;:&quot;I, Riley Foster, am the tenant under an indefinite ordinary residential lease for Synthetic Rosenweg 33, 8008 Zurich, canton Zurich. The landlord in this fictional supplement is Synthetische Wohnraum AG. Current monthly net rent is CHF1800; the landlord maintains the fixed central heating and circulation pump. The lease requires usable heated living rooms in winter.&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;b6059e7a5d663f6263675c100f3bc5c399341ad57108a6730b10171a4db10615&quot;,&quot;start_char&quot;:610,&quot;text_sha256&quot;:&quot;b6059e7a5d663f6263675c100f3bc5c399341ad57108a6730b10171a4db10615&quot;}\">Source evidence · 01-customer-and-tenancy-clarification.txt</button></li><li class=\"au-obligation\" data-au-obligation=\"obligation:dh_notice:landlord_knowledge_evidence\" data-au-document=\"landlord_knowledge_evidence\" data-status=\"established\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-document-open au-document-choice\" data-au-select=\"dh_notice\" data-au-select-document=\"landlord_knowledge_evidence\" data-au-select-obligation=\"obligation:dh_notice:landlord_knowledge_evidence\" data-au-select-fact=\"fact:landlord_knowledge_evidence\"><strong>Landlord knowledge and continuing repair status</strong><span class=\"au-document-state au-document-route\">Established</span><span class=\"au-document-review\" data-au-review=\"sufficient\">Supplied evidence is sufficient. <span aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span></span><span class=\"au-document-decision\">Establish landlord knowledge</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-link au-document-source\" data-au-source=\"src_6c895ee56c7a6b33aaeebe06d530eb4b\" data-au-source-origin=\"requirement:obligation:dh_notice:landlord_knowledge_evidence\" data-au-citation=\"{&quot;artifact_id&quot;:&quot;src_6c895ee56c7a6b33aaeebe06d530eb4b&quot;,&quot;end_char&quot;:1029,&quot;quote&quot;:&quot;Our fictional call log records Riley Foster's three heating-failure reports on 2025-02-01, 2025-02-08, 2025-02-17. Each report identified the same rented flat and recurrent stoppage of the fixed heating. We received the first report on2025-02-01; this is the landlord's first documented knowledge of the defect.&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;ae66233b1e2853056ced10f26ebe615adef8fb17bf18293a94b93a984825576c&quot;,&quot;start_char&quot;:718,&quot;text_sha256&quot;:&quot;ae66233b1e2853056ced10f26ebe615adef8fb17bf18293a94b93a984825576c&quot;}\">Source evidence · 03-landlord-knowledge-and-repair-status.txt</button></li><li class=\"au-obligation\" data-au-obligation=\"obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-document=\"objective_defect_observation\" data-status=\"established\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-document-open au-document-choice\" data-au-select=\"dh_evidence\" data-au-select-document=\"objective_defect_observation\" data-au-select-obligation=\"obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-select-fact=\"fact:objective_defect_observation\"><strong>Dated technical defect observation</strong><span class=\"au-document-state au-document-route\">Established</span><span class=\"au-document-review\" data-au-review=\"sufficient\">Supplied evidence is sufficient. <span aria-hidden=\"true\">✓</span></span><span class=\"au-document-decision\">Assess objective defect evidence</span></button><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-link au-document-source\" data-au-source=\"src_3fa6e00ca8e24d41c3af7915f43a21bd\" data-au-source-origin=\"requirement:obligation:dh_evidence:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-citation=\"{&quot;artifact_id&quot;:&quot;src_3fa6e00ca8e24d41c3af7915f43a21bd&quot;,&quot;end_char&quot;:1309,&quot;quote&quot;:&quot;On 2025-02-21 at07:30, a calibrated digital instrument (fictional calibration check2024-12-15, uncertainty±0.2C) measured the living room at15.8C after overnight normal operation. Main living rooms stayed15.5–16.3C in the seven-day logger record. Resets restore heat briefly; the pump cuts out repeatedly. The fixed circulation pump has an internal bearing/control failure; it is part of landlord-maintained equipment, outside ordinary small tenant maintenance. Normal ventilation and unobstructed radiators were observed; no tenant alteration or misuse explains the failure.&quot;,&quot;sha256&quot;:&quot;ad1d46adcf2f5cff2e4be0b9db7bbc5fdd07577badbea246604470f38bcf9fa3&quot;,&quot;start_char&quot;:734,&quot;text_sha256&quot;:&quot;ad1d46adcf2f5cff2e4be0b9db7bbc5fdd07577badbea246604470f38bcf9fa3&quot;}\">Source evidence · 02-heating-service-observation.txt</button></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"au-secondary\" data-au-detail=\"documents\">All recorded requirements</button></aside><svg class=\"au-forming-connections\" aria-hidden=\"true\" data-au-wire-fact=\"fact:objective_defect_observation\" data-au-wire-source=\"src_3fa6e00ca8e24d41c3af7915f43a21bd\" data-au-wire-node=\"dh_evidence\" data-au-wire-obligation=\"obl